                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.34/607: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-06-01T23:00:00-04:00">June 1, 1942—11 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>785. Your 978, May 26, 5 p.m. Please present the Department’s note.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
